## Non-Medical Research & Educational Disclaimer
This hardware and firmware repository is developed solely for educational experimentation, wearable sensor skill building, and academic demonstration.

1. NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE: This prototype is not a certified medical device and has not received regulatory clearance or approval from the FDA, CDSCO, CE, or any health authority.
2. NO DIAGNOSTIC CLAIM: This device must never be used to diagnose, treat, mitigate, or monitor sleep apnea, hypoxemia, arrhythmia, or any other physiological condition.
3. PROTOTYPE ALERT: The system generates an experimental "breathing pause alert (prototype)" for educational observation of chest motion dynamics only.
